OL,3,GNEWSACollege will cover cost of
OL,4,Astudents learning to drive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA college has opened the UK's first
OL,7,Fvirtual reality simulators to train
OL,8,Fstudents how to drive before they hit
OL,9,Fthe roads.
OL,11,FThe Driver Accreditation Scheme (DAS)
OL,12,Fat Barnsley College enables them to
OL,13,Fgain their provisional licence and
OL,14,Fdriving experience by using the new
OL,15,Ftechnology.
OL,17,FAround 200 students a year will take
OL,18,Fpart in the driving academy, with
OL,19,Ffinancial support from the college.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
